    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "point-2",
      "narration_text": "Then git broke. Fifteen files in the repo have colons in their names, which Windows can't check out, so the index showed fifteen phantom deletions, and a commit from there would have really deleted them. I repaired it and moved the work to a Linux copy of the repo.",
